# Dropdowns & pick lists (do not regress)

Canonical: `docs/DEV.md` § Dropdowns, pick lists and tips (+ bug **7j**). Code: each app's `src/popup.rs` (own copy per app, no shared core).

## Required

```text
open state          app state only (suggest_open / Khaynjo dish|category_picker_open), read at draw time
open                tap on the field (press+release ≤24 px, <0.8 s, same field) | typing | ↓ | the dd button
close               route_popup_input: press outside field+list+opener+panel → close, press still delivered
                    pick (single choice) · Back/Escape · set_screen (every screen change)
pointer hit tests   clipped_rect (screen_rect / area_hit) against event.abs
draw-time tests     rect() + page_viewport() (clipped rects resolve only after the root turtle ends)
floating list       PopupAnchor{key} in the field box (last, Fill×Fill) + AnchoredPopup{key} at window root
                    Fixed opaque card (Fill content + solid draw_bg); begin_overlay_last
no wheel            self-scrolling lists: mouse_drag_scrolling: true
ℹ tips              hidden on every press (fingers send no hover-out)
```

- New dd button list → add it to `SuggestField::opener()` (Khaynjo); never a new if-chain.
- New floating list → add its path to `APP_POPUPS` (Khaynjo).
- Typing that only narrows a list → `redraw_suggest_lists` (or the pick-list widget). Never full `sync_chrome` on every key (IME / Settings SQL freeze). Reserve `sync_chrome` for open, pick, Escape, Back, and focus-elsewhere close.

## Forbidden

```text
❌ Modal for a dropdown / pick list            → open flag outlives the state; invisible full-window press sink
❌ opening a list on TextInputAction::KeyFocus → Modal::close's revert_key_focus reopens it every time
❌ placing a popup once at open                → gap = scroll distance; drifts off its field
❌ area().rect() for a pointer hit test        → hidden (scrolled-under) part still "contains" the press
❌ outside-press close after a pointer handler that can `return` → list carried onto the next screen
❌ per-control special cases (field == "…")   → fix the rule in popup.rs for every list
❌ full sync_chrome on every SuggestList keystroke → redraw the list only
❌ Fit-height floating popup content over a busy page → Floor/scroll shows through; use Fixed opaque card
```
